\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Robust z-scores (median / MAD)
\f1\b0  replace 
\f2\fs26 mean + k\'b7SD
\f1\fs24 . With a single dominant artefact component the classic rule is nearly unreachable (the outlier inflates its own mean and SD; the maximum achievable z is 
\f2\fs26 (N-1)/\uc0\u8730 N
\f1\fs24 ). Median/MAD is immune to this.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 All temporal detectors locate their window from 
\f2\fs26 comp.time
\f1\fs24  
\f0\b per trial
\f1\b0 , so there is no assumption about trial/segment structure (the original 
\f2\fs26 TEFAR_v3
\f1\fs24  hard-coded a 3-segments-per-trial layout).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Usage\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs26 \cf0 % TMS-EEG, drop-in for the old call (existing pipeline unchanged):\
[comp, line_c, musc_c, decay_c, addmusc_c, rech_c, blink_c] = ...\
    TEFAR_tms(data_filtered, trl);\
\
% ...or grab the full result (scores, metrics, populated cfg):\
[comp, ~,~,~,~,~,~, artifacts] = TEFAR_tms(data_filtered, trl);\
artifacts.reject      % suggested components\
artifacts.score       % detectors firing per component\
artifacts.metrics     % all per-component metric vectors\
\
% Ordinary EEG:\
[comp, artifacts] = TEFAR_eeg(data);\
\
% Override any default (e.g. US mains, stricter line rule, score-based reject):\
cfg = struct('line_freq',60,'reject_rule','score','reject_threshold',2);\
cfg.line.z = 6;\
[comp, artifacts] = TEFAR_eeg(data, cfg);\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 reject_rule
\f1\fs24  is 
\f2\fs26 'union'
\f1\fs24  by default (any detector flags 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  suggest removal), matching the original behaviour. Set 
\f2\fs26 'score'
\f1\fs24  to require agreement across 
\f2\fs26 reject_threshold
\f1\fs24  detectors instead. Either way, TEFAR only 
\f0\b suggests
\f1\b0  \'97 confirm by visual inspection before rejecting.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

