\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The refactor also fixes a few latent issues in the original: 
\f2\fs26 kurtosis()
\f1\fs24  required the Statistics toolbox (now local); the recharge window 
\f2\fs26 -1.5\'851.5 s
\f1\fs24  selected the whole segment; decay used signed-mean (sign cancellation) rather than RMS; and the multi-metric 
\f2\fs26 score
\f1\fs24  was computed but never actually used for rejection (the pipeline took the union of all categories). All are addressed here.\
